114
00:04:48,829 --> 00:04:51,028
Periksa metadata setelah impor.

115
00:04:51,662 --> 00:04:54,201
Gunakan satu gaya sitasi dari awal.

116
00:04:54,788 --> 00:04:56,763
Cadangkan library secara berkala.

117
00:04:57,589 --> 00:04:59,913
Penyimpanan gratis Mendeley terbatas dua

118
00:04:59,913 --> 00:05:00,436
gigabyte.

119
00:05:00,824 --> 00:05:03,103
Cukup untuk ratusan PDF, tetapi file

120
00:05:03,103 --> 00:05:05,446
penting tetap perlu disalin ke tempat

121
00:05:05,446 --> 00:05:05,763
lain.

122
00:05:06,439 --> 00:05:08,811
Kalau tiga kebiasaan ini dijalankan,

123
00:05:08,811 --> 00:05:11,513
sitasi dan daftar pustaka Anda konsisten.

124
00:05:12,155 --> 00:05:12,744
Terima kasih.
